    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470120/extras/9497b6d98eb322093b5ed9aa27448099.avif?t=1726282299\" /></div><br><br><br>A story where &quot;The Soul is the World&quot;.<br>It is an eden we would be willing to sacrifice everything for.<br>It is about &quot;Atopes&quot;, which grants your soul the ability to exceed its limits.<br><br>Experience the dramatic turn of events, and see the world change around you.<br><br><br>\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015<br><strong>You, the player,</strong> are expected to do great things.<br>The protagonist of the story isn't the flying bunny rabbit, but <strong>&quot;you&quot;</strong> in front of the monitor.<br>Everything in this game, is to be fully internalized by <strong>&quot;you&quot;</strong> .<br><br>To pursue the end of the story, you must awaken from that world, and transfer to the new world.<br><br>If you're in a dream, will you be able to tell that it's a dream?<br><br><br><br>\u30fbGenre<br>Philosophy (+Shoot 'em Up, etc.)<br><br>\u30fbGame Engine<br>Unity<br><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Certain features of this game may prove troublesome to live stream.<br></li><li>To check where the files were installed, click this link.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470120/extras/9497b6d98eb322093b5ed9aa27448099.avif?t=1726282299\" /></div><br><br><br>A story where &quot;The Soul is the World&quot;.<br>It is an eden we would be willing to sacrifice everything for.<br>It is about &quot;Atopes&quot;, which grants your soul the ability to exceed its limits.<br><br>Experience the dramatic turn of events, and see the world change around you.<br><br><br>\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015<br><strong>You, the player,</strong> are expected to do great things.<br>The protagonist of the story isn't the flying bunny rabbit, but <strong>&quot;you&quot;</strong> in front of the monitor.<br>Everything in this game, is to be fully internalized by <strong>&quot;you&quot;</strong> .<br><br>To pursue the end of the story, you must awaken from that world, and transfer to the new world.<br><br>If you're in a dream, will you be able to tell that it's a dream?<br><br><br><br>\u30fbGenre<br>Philosophy (+Shoot 'em Up, etc.)<br><br>\u30fbGame Engine<br>Unity<br><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Certain features of this game may prove troublesome to live stream.<br></li><li>To check where the files were installed, click this link.</li></ul>",
